      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "{\"recorded_count\": 22, \"total_count\": 22, \"missing_ids\": [], \"complete\": true, \"results\": [{\"item_id\": \"FT-1\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Data persistence bug - Create Product\", \"actual\": \"Creating a new product (\\\"QA Test Gadget\\\") in Admin panel shows \\\"Product created successfully\\\" toast and appears in the in-session admin list, but the new product is absent from /products and vanishes from the admin list itself after a fresh navigation to /admin. Changes are never persisted to any backing store.\", \"evidence\": \"Created \\\"QA Test Gadget\\\", confirmed toast, then navigated to /products (not found) and re-navigated /admin (product gone).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-2\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Data persistence bug - Edit Product\", \"actual\": \"Editing \\\"Theragun Pro\\\" (price $649, rating 4.6, added tag, changed description, toggled Featured) shows \\\"Product updated successfully\\\" toast, but /product/theragun-pro and /products still show old data ($599, rating 4.5), and a fresh /admin navigation reverts the admin panel's own display to original values.\", \"evidence\": \"Verified via public product detail page, /products listing, and fresh /admin reload - all show pre-edit values.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-3\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/products listing page correctly renders all seeded products with accurate name, category, price, rating, and image for each card.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-4\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Data persistence bug - Featured toggle\", \"actual\": \"Toggling \\\"Featured on homepage\\\" switch during edit is accepted in the form and shows success toast, but is not reflected on the public homepage/product cards after navigation, and reverts on fresh admin reload - consistent with the general CRUD persistence failure.\", \"evidence\": \"Tested as part of Theragun Pro edit; Featured flag not persisted.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Data persistence bug - Admin edits don't survive navigation\", \"actual\": \"Any field update (price, rating, description, tags) made via the Admin edit form is only reflected in transient client state; re-navigating to /admin from scratch reverts the panel's own list to pre-edit values, confirming no backend/store write occurs.\", \"evidence\": \"Re-navigated to /admin after editing Theragun Pro - all fields reverted to originals.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Data persistence bug - Delete Product\", \"actual\": \"Deleting \\\"Philips Hue Starter Kit\\\" (via delete icon + confirm dialog) shows \\\"Product deleted successfully\\\" toast and removes it from the in-session list, but the product reappears unchanged after a fresh navigation to /admin, proving the delete was never persisted.\", \"evidence\": \"Confirmed dialog accept, product vanished from list, then reappeared on fresh /admin navigation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Data persistence bug - Category reassignment\", \"actual\": \"Changed \\\"Breville Barista Express\\\" category from Home Goods to Fitness via Admin edit form and saved successfully, but the product does not appear on /category/fitness and a fresh /admin reload shows it still under Home Goods.\", \"evidence\": \"Checked /category/fitness after save - only Bowflex, Theragun, Peloton listed; Breville absent. Fresh /admin reload shows category reverted to Home.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Category filter on /products correctly narrows results to matching category with accurate product counts.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Sort control (e.g., by price) correctly reorders product list client-side without page reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Keyword search box filters product list correctly to matching product names/descriptions in real time.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Critical architectural bug - Admin CRUD never persists\", \"actual\": \"All Admin Panel CRUD operations (Create, Edit, Delete) only mutate ephemeral/local UI state. None are persisted to any backing store shared with public pages (/products, /product/[slug]) or even with the admin panel's own state on re-navigation. Success toasts are shown but are misleading since no data is actually saved.\", \"evidence\": \"Confirmed via three independent tests: create (\\\"QA Test Gadget\\\"), edit (Theragun Pro, Breville Barista Express), and delete (Philips Hue Starter Kit) - all reverted/vanished after fresh navigation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Navigating to an invalid product slug (e.g., /product/nonexistent-item) correctly renders a not-found state instead of crashing or showing blank content.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Navigating to an invalid category slug correctly renders a not-found/empty state instead of erroring.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting the Create Product form with all required fields empty (Name, Short Description) triggered \\\"Please fill in all required fields\\\" toast and no product was created; form remained open for correction.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting Create Product form with out-of-range values (Price: -50, Rating: 10) with all required text fields filled resulted in no product being created and no success toast - invalid boundary values are blocked from being saved.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Price range slider - keyboard inaccessible, mislabeled\", \"actual\": \"The price-range filter slider (role=\\\"slider\\\") is mislabeled with aria-label=\\\"Minimum\\\" despite functioning as a maximum-price upper bound. Keyboard interaction (ArrowRight, End after clicking/focusing the thumb) had zero effect on aria-valuenow or displayed price/product count. Only a precise pixel-coordinate drag succeeded in moving it.\", \"evidence\": \"document.activeElement confirmed thumb had focus; aria-valuenow remained \\\"0\\\" after multiple key presses; drag via injected marker element moved slider and changed max price label from $2495 to $1250, filtering count from 9 to 5.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking tag chips in the Filters panel correctly applies multi-select tag filtering and updates the product list accordingly.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"\\\"Buy Now\\\" link on product detail page opens the affiliate URL in a new tab with target=\\\"_blank\\\" and rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" (verified via browser_evaluate on the anchor element).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking the delete icon button in Admin panel correctly triggers a native confirm() dialog (\\\"Are you sure you want to delete...\\\") before proceeding; accepting/dismissing the dialog behaves as expected at the UI-interaction level (separate from the underlying persistence bug).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Product detail pages render the full, untruncated review text along with name, category, price, rating, tags, specifications, and image consistent with list/card view data.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Seeded products use relevant, consistent category and tag values (e.g., Sony WH-1000XM5 tagged \\\"headphones, wireless, noise-cancelling, premium\\\" under Tech; Dyson V15 Detect tagged \\\"vacuum\\\" etc. under Home; Breville Barista Express tagged \\\"coffee, espresso, kitchen, appliance\\\") - all tags/categories are contextually appropriate across browsing and detail views.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Prices and ratings are formatted consistently across list, category, and detail views (e.g., \\\"$2,495\\\" with thousands separator, ratings shown as single-decimal \\\"4.6\\\" alongside 5-star icon rendering) with no discrepancies observed between views.\"}]}"
