    "content": "All 22 checklist items have been recorded and confirmed complete (22/22, no missing IDs).\n\n**Summary:** 15 PASS, 7 FAIL. The 7 failures (FT-1, FT-2, FT-4, FT-5, FT-6, FT-7, FT-19) all trace back to a single critical root-cause bug: the Admin Panel's Create/Edit/Delete operations only mutate ephemeral client-side state — they show success toasts but never persist to any backing store, so changes are invisible on public pages and even vanish from the admin panel itself on a fresh reload. This was independently verified three ways (create, edit, delete) plus a direct category-reassignment test.\n\nThe one additional failure, IX-13, is an independent UI/accessibility defect: the price-range slider is mislabeled (`aria-label=\"Minimum\"` on what functions as a max-price bound) and is not operable via keyboard, only via precise mouse drag.\n\nAll other functional areas — public browsing/filtering/sorting/search, product detail rendering, tag-chip filtering, Buy Now links, not-found states, form validation (required fields and numeric boundaries), delete confirmation dialog, and content/data consistency — passed verification."
  }
}
